{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "4f194d6d002d62908cadb5b9dc150d41e3911e769790bcb03a8ffd64ec044feb", "ja": "†運命と煉獄の円舞曲†", "zh": "†命运与炼狱的圆舞曲†", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "42108f635cd071a8f09e903fcd84c4fe61e51f2c9eca82aa6fec0287b51cfb72", "ja": "ゴスロリの世界観を理解するために、オリジ\nナルの鬼ごっこ『運命と煉獄の円舞曲』をや\nりだすメンバー達。遊びを通じてコンセプト\nを理解するだけでなく、仲間の絆を深めてい\nく一同を、頼もしく感じるプロデューサー。", "zh": "为了理解歌德萝莉的世界观，成员们开始玩起\n自己独创的捉迷藏『命运与炼狱的圆舞曲』。\n一行人不仅透过游戏加深了对主题的理解，\n同时也增强了伙伴之间的情谊，\n让制作人相当心安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1d6d47b4aba604796bb4e21ae3f711a9dbb6b07718a3951e6836b741466852e5", "ja": "（ユニットの世界観を理解するため、今日は全員で\n劇場の裏手に集まった。今度は何をするんだろう？）", "zh": "（为了理解这个团体的世界观，今天所有人\n都到剧场后面集合了。这次要做些什么呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "c1bf129fbd49a80fa936e9cec762dfb8b2571c801a2a509d69c99214a56fd0ca", "ja": "みなさん、本日はお日柄もよく。というのは冗談です。\nお集まりいただき、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "各位，在今天这个黄道吉日……没有啦，开玩笑的～\n先谢谢大家到这边集合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "f509039217932814a5c540ce109afd681ac6cd9ede9ab4e63c6f4252ce1c1a5e", "ja": "ゴシックロリータの世界観を知り、理解を深める。\nそのために、鬼ごっこをします。", "zh": "我们要弄懂歌德风萝莉塔的世界观，并加深对它的理解。\n因此，我们要来玩捉迷藏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "38ce625d958638cf2530f11616ab2477ba51e6484e8dd39fed1121ced2c1587f", "ja": "タイトルは、名付けて『運命と煉獄の円舞曲』。\n……かっこいいぞ。", "zh": "名字就取作『命运与炼狱的圆舞曲』。\n……超帅的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e3b64c8d2a18cf2bdfafa87e1442b49dc619f791b19195bb9aadc7c0a521af2e", "ja": "（……世界観が理解できそうな気がする鬼ごっこだ！）", "zh": "（……感觉是能理解这个世界观的捉迷藏啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "fe9f536bbef564fc011443d27dd108ffe95a9e1b360a3a4a5e93a02a8c8e2fce", "ja": "杏奈も……ルールの、アイディア出したり……\n協力、した……よ。", "zh": "杏奈也有……帮忙出点子……\n想游戏规则……哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "d44315a51a347787d7d6e09072afe273878b4e26853391e34643d1b9cb7cbc61", "ja": "ロコもです！　本当は、テーブルトークRPG風に\nパッケージングしたかったんですけど～。", "zh": "ROCO也有！其实原本是想Packaging成\nTable Talk RPG风格的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "c5270c332f85350edb29698efeb7437bf42e52c57ffd70a8201887746679cd5a", "ja": "とはいえ、これもレッスンです。\nそれではみなさんに、ルールを説明していきましょう。", "zh": "话虽如此，这也是一种练习。\n那么各位，请听我们说明规则。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "6dbd8cf5abea7e624b65c7b4963d09e33382792b6ade3802538a4d3d0c82e63f", "ja": "最初に動けるのは、2人だけになります。\n鬼である『人形使い』と、『鍵』です。", "zh": "一开始只有两个人能动，\n分别是负责当鬼的『操偶师』和『钥匙』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "a088050509af43d0e3c02b4de2fd7d616a6e34050bd4eb2cbef1ff0a5916aff3", "ja": "『鍵』が……動けない仲間をタッチすると、解放……\nその人形も、自由……今度は、仲間を助けられる……。", "zh": "『钥匙』能……触碰不能动的伙伴，让对方恢复自由……\n恢复自由的人偶……也能去帮助其他伙伴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "1b7dd0a11308d0af3a5bc9b4d634da57c0e668fd0864289df5be6470c10f8413", "ja": "でも、『人形使い』にタッチされたらバインドです！\nまたドントムーブですよ！", "zh": "可是，被『操偶师』Touch到就会被Bind！\n回到Don't Move的状态！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "8bd303d1982340fd1f8c0b14e4b1bdefd30c3d83aa8972745e2f06b4cbf1733e", "ja": "先に全員を束縛、または解放した方の勝利です。\n初回の『人形使い』は私がやるので、『鍵』は……。", "zh": "先束缚或释放所有人的一方即胜利。\n第一次先由我当『操偶师』，至于『钥匙』就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "23840f833fd78b07449d98010a138557d11e965fa247e9db7a73cc49ead217ff", "ja": "じゃあ、オレがやる！　これって、\nこおり鬼みたいなもんだろ？　面白そうじゃん！", "zh": "让我来吧！这个游戏就像是比较特殊的鬼抓人吧？\n感觉很有意思嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "b7ff90a7d876a9e722fc6ad2b6e64513e54f7c3adafd610bc8a74c16ec777d52", "ja": "配役も決まりましたね。\nとりあえず、やってみましょう！", "zh": "角色都分配好了呢。\n我们就先玩玩看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0c63f15b35d1ae7f2863596950665020c27d270503e290c47f0b3d8c7bfcd528", "ja": "なら、俺はひとまず邪魔にならないところで\nみんなを見守ることにするよ。みんな、頑張れ！", "zh": "那我就先到不会干扰你们的地方看着吧，\n大家加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "94aff3cf1ed6c290b3bfd9cf2ed9a619d198e96243981b80a5d5d9ef1c9d4cd6", "ja": "よっしゃ！　これでロコに続いて、\n杏奈も解放だぜ！", "zh": "好耶！救完ROCO之后，\n也释放了杏奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "7fe355356fca115a24f2d8195b3d5961aa810d5859f9ea830cb5833c1b7e1efd", "ja": "ナイスです、スバル！\nこれでロコもフリーダムです！", "zh": "Nice，昴！\n这样ROCO也恢复Freedom了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "2f8bbca52affe4d104a03590846ef777b0d2fbe7f546b4a907a998ad15b0aac8", "ja": "杏奈、も……。\nがんばって、逃げなきゃ……。", "zh": "杏奈也是……\n要努力逃跑才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6f52cb8406a433f77fc3073da516a2f9caf0736076c014d96a3a5ac24284b5a2", "ja": "（流石、体を使ったゲームになると昴のフットワークは\n大したものだな。残るは百合子だけか……おや？）", "zh": "（真不愧是昴，在这种需要体能的游戏中，行动特别敏捷。\n现在就剩百合子一个了……奇怪？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "bfb376a50fcc1725a94efa98433951139f442d9e7becda2efe6abae16c6f1647", "ja": "このまま百合子も解放して、\nあっという間にゲームセットだぜ！", "zh": "照这个气势让百合子也恢复自由，\n这一局就会立刻被我们拿下了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "9ef4e6e218f443643cf9339a18ea2cc41133a7d246a4fd81b9a287164941bba1", "ja": "昴さん！　今私のほうに来ちゃダメです！", "zh": "昴！现在不可以过来我这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "3659a26da84128e1052d75474afc934dfcb49ae4f14d235bf409d51ca5bda70c", "ja": "え？　……うわっ！？", "zh": "咦？哇啊……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "648ed22c460a4ac3d654e8d6194d5253696203fb0a9a8097ddc63f483439b5e5", "ja": "タッチ。……永吉さんは、人形になりました。", "zh": "碰到了……永吉变成人偶了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "e09963badba6752d8bcad0540b3ebd68c0aa5a1ca429705290a7dc8d95991a7b", "ja": "しまった～、タッチされちゃった……！\n瑞希、百合子の後ろに隠れてたのか！", "zh": "糟糕～被碰到了……！\n原来瑞希躲在百合子后面啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "cd7bab05e6830576212a32904e8491dc2ede99802c6ce930f8e187c2beb687a6", "ja": "はい。七尾さんは囮です。永吉さんを封じてしまえば、\n人形たちの戦力は半減します。……反撃開始。", "zh": "是的，七尾是诱饵，只要成功封住永吉，\n人偶方的战力就会减半……反击开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "2935519d2e12ccfbb3380db010d370c2cf42811f09a903671836383967326d78", "ja": "運命の糸から逃れることは、できません。\n……ただの一人も。", "zh": "休想逃离命运之线。\n……我一个都不会放过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1060_p", "source_sha256": "c7d95f74fbeff977e362535e404426051a7c797e1f26b9d064223ecbb877b827", "ja": "（昴は捕まってしまったが、その後杏奈とロコの活躍で\n百合子も解放される展開になった！）", "zh": "（昴虽然被抓到了，但后来杏奈和ROCO大显身手，\n让百合子也被释放了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "3c7de7a3f312ac36afff3603fd14c246fd91fb1953e340a4c95fbab34fc2327e", "ja": "ほら、杏奈！　そこ、くぐり抜けるんだって！\n追いつかれちゃうぞ！", "zh": "喂，杏奈！快点穿过那里！\n不然要被追上了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "87d9a1b1b473a9e26e0d9e909908a71c1f1b72a82b4b8ddbd3e739668ee9b52c", "ja": "あー！！　ロコ、ジャンプだジャンプ！\n瑞希を飛び越せ！", "zh": "啊──！！ROCO，快点跳起来！\n跳过瑞希的头顶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1028_025roc", "source_sha256": "0033ef45900a1093301d4d3458fc00f4195b0adb81b6b65b8c5c64b8cc1095fb", "ja": "そ、そんなハイジャンプ、ロコには無理ですよ～！\nそれに、もう……体力が……！", "zh": "那、那种High Jump，ROCO哪办得到～！\n而且……ROCO已经……跑不动了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "a2538eba4cd3098eada1c63ba077184e0d8c739ab711e3ea9ecca2f3c7c4b19d", "ja": "さあ。みなさん、人形に戻りましょう。\n怯えることはありません。さあ。", "zh": "来吧，大家……乖乖变回人偶吧。\n用不着害怕，来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1030_024ann", "source_sha256": "923979458ec89410cfa8384b4dec3cf985e36336856f08de57e7090a3db0edb2", "ja": "み、瑞希さん……ちょっと、怖い……かも。\n本物の、人形使い……みたい……。", "zh": "瑞、瑞希……好像有点……可怕。\n就跟真的……操偶师……一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "ff51c25a1bb6190db81df5f009a33f3eb05ebc2531f315c2d5e93cb00f701ed4", "ja": "仲間が捕まってるのに……この状況でオレ、\n何もできないのかよ！　ううっ、体さえ動けば……！", "zh": "伙伴一个接一个被抓……难道我在这种情况下\n什么都做不到吗！呜呜，只要能动的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "fe5abbf84c7ece8bde8a12ff9806d1ebccc28e3a19a63754e94d6b45a9b91cdc", "ja": "（主戦力である昴を封じられたままだと、\n鬼である瑞希の勝利になりそうだけど……）", "zh": "（只要昴这个主要战力被封死，\n那当鬼的瑞希应该是稳赢的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "f17ba17da74af753a738ab3f5987853e10946df29c95dc494dfc1a02a550b97b", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん、ロコちゃん！　私に、作戦があります！", "zh": "小杏、ROCO！我有个作战计划！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1034_024ann", "source_sha256": "13c5b70134f04962e0a7c6ebeb04610b065ecf0dc5c842e779e642e2ed15a1ba", "ja": "ん……わかったよ、百合子さん……。\nやってみる、ね……。", "zh": "嗯……百合子……杏奈明白了……\n杏奈试试看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1035_025roc", "source_sha256": "191af8e5ea404bbaf0012f5569075c3ff680827f2a02b0c8cc40e7ee7cacc2d4", "ja": "なるほど……オッケーです。このまま続けても、\nきっとノーフューチャーですから。", "zh": "原来如此……OK的，不然这样耗下去，\n肯定也是No Future。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "626658be9b8ff1cbdaa486a9ba16a7a7fc0fa4ef57d202af967034b3ad3b4dec", "ja": "3人が、バラバラに散らばった……？\nすこし厄介ですが、特に問題では……。", "zh": "三个人往不同的地方散开了……？\n虽然有点麻烦，但这不成问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "b38c0551fc3e2901c0f59560ee6817db358f53bc7d46ad638a0637556a63898c", "ja": "いくよ、みんな！　……せーの！", "zh": "大家，要上啰！……预备～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "9d68f6a0deb429203ec310421a6cba833b8c118fd5eac6f712c1558cce851826", "ja": "勝負は、百合子が自由にした昴が全員解放して、\n『人形』の勝利か……。なかなか熱い展開だったな！", "zh": "最后是昴被百合子救了之后释放了所有人，\n『人偶』方胜利……真是精彩的发展啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1039_044miz", "source_sha256": "93e50c32f8cd0ea3eeee0c9479625ffb64afb76f5092a0d66725d9eda5661c90", "ja": "むむ。惜しいところまでいったのですが……\nくやしいです。……ワンモア、セット。", "zh": "唔唔，差点就赢了……\n好不甘心……再比一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1040_025roc", "source_sha256": "14a8c9ce6dd1f971c8336ad8047c8019e982c894507e091d5b188a2fc0335abc", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\nろ、ロコはもう、ノットサンキューです……。", "zh": "呼、呼……\nRO、ROCO已经、Not Thank You了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1041_024ann", "source_sha256": "d69fb29eef5e9cf990d6521978638e8a0415157d1428323cbd91b8dab1d311c3", "ja": "はぁ……ふぅ……、杏奈、も……。", "zh": "呼……呼……杏奈、也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1042_047sub", "source_sha256": "53e1373d47d1d57e436e7c937a1fe41d6dc4a83a6dd1f4402d1f8dc3effa3107", "ja": "やったな、百合子！　人形にされた時は、\nもうダメかと思ったけど……逆転勝利だぜ！", "zh": "赢了呢，百合子！被变成人偶的时候，\n我还以为输定了……幸好最后成功逆转了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1043_047sub", "source_sha256": "357a04a9ad49e5f7654225cf2d979493dccd4d706a0c9b2fdcd19b8bfc824be7", "ja": "目の前でみんなが苦しんでるのに、オレ、何も\nできないとか。すっげー、もどかしくってさ……。", "zh": "大家就在自己面前受苦，但我却无能为力，\n当下真的觉得心急如焚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1044_026yur", "source_sha256": "5f16bd3fae542ba169c7ec46550996d1788f2c0544860788cd576ad595c9fb9b", "ja": "はい。この『運命と煉獄の円舞曲』には、\n人形たちの持つ切なさが、こめられていた気がします！", "zh": "是啊，我觉得这个『命运与炼狱的圆舞曲』，\n确实呈现出了人偶们心中的哀痛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1045_026yur", "source_sha256": "a07c2cad3f2334da182b4bed7e78077a49778f361c498dd35ab6ef126d5e1a99", "ja": "人形……マリオネットは、自分の好きに動くことは\nできません。苦しむ仲間たちを、見ているだけ……。", "zh": "人偶……牵线木偶没办法随心所欲地活动。\n只能眼睁睁看着伙伴们受苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1046_026yur", "source_sha256": "d0a7232236fadb17614088b01b0f3cc6dad45edbbbc4b8ba6fdf678c58750b98", "ja": "そんな、言葉にならないもどかしさ、想い……\nこれもひとつの、ゴシックな世界観だと思います！", "zh": "这种难以言喻的着急心情……\n我认为也算是歌德风世界观的一种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1047_047sub", "source_sha256": "f860efb95935d298e14b1e8020635dc9b3c95384e03a65699e596d6f9842c13d", "ja": "つまり、オレたちは自由に動けない人形ってわけか。\n……うん。オレ、なんとなくわかった気がするよ！", "zh": "也就是说，我们是不能自由活动的人偶对吧。\n……嗯，我好像有点明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1048_026yur", "source_sha256": "c86245d3c1eecdb26785c7c3be284f33b7b10710663c6bc3814c8825955eb435", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか！？", "zh": "真、真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1049_047sub", "source_sha256": "aebf7ca97755e6559e45bb353fcf9a51f4b1b8c2e3c2019f53d1ffa6e67253e7", "ja": "ああ！　うまく言葉にできないけど、もしオレたちが\n生きてる世界がこんなだったら、きついもんな。", "zh": "是啊！虽然我不会形容，但要是我们\n活在那样的世界，一定是很痛苦的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1050_026yur", "source_sha256": "dd65056149436743e55d289d7c374795a60c3cf512720c49314090092b5cadf4", "ja": "よかったぁ……！\n昴さん、本当にありがとうございます！", "zh": "太好了……！\n昴，真的很谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1051_026yur", "source_sha256": "be611bea30fd1b645c7ab71ee41b8cc921551bb77989b3d28e9c423de517eb2d", "ja": "真剣に向き合ってくれて……\n私、とってもうれしかったです！", "zh": "你这么认真地努力理解……\n我真的非常高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1052_047sub", "source_sha256": "b770f2256ac3b8357951a6ce76c39fa64fd66786a00bdfd2e4692ae2595e42d4", "ja": "改めて言われるとなんか照れるけど……でもよかった！\nこれで何とかなるよな、{$P$}！", "zh": "你这样郑重地说，我反倒有点害羞……不过，太好了！\n这样应该有办法表演了吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1053_p", "source_sha256": "ef54dac16530546b0148c53dc67659829618d832ccad878df79f8858c992e586", "ja": "ああ。\n昴がそう言うなら、きっと大丈夫だ！", "zh": "是啊，既然你都这么说了，\n那肯定没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1054_044miz", "source_sha256": "9b422b578d97c0818f67a54da2228f3d6444af96fd72f2bd2481b91eabbb85e3", "ja": "『運命と煉獄の円舞曲』作戦、大成功です。\n私たちのユニットも、大成功間違いなしです。ぶい。", "zh": "『命运与炼狱的圆舞曲』作战非常成功。\n我们这个团体肯定也会赢得满堂喝采，耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1055_025roc", "source_sha256": "a245fa3cfc10762657ae779447b6dcf663bd4625cbca4c89dc14a8664c442f20", "ja": "スバルがユニットのコンセプトをキャッチできて、\nよかったです！　けど、タイアードです～。", "zh": "昴能够Catch到Unit的Concept真是太好了！\n不过，ROCO已经Tired了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1056_024ann", "source_sha256": "eac2c3d71dbf2109eb6311f29b23c0cff59b70d7812795be1d8d88e2674797bd", "ja": "うん……杏奈も……。\n早く、戻って……休憩、しよ……？", "zh": "嗯……杏奈也是……\n我们快点……回去休息吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1057_026yur", "source_sha256": "7e46f65d1a4035e4644162485d31109f737cb9e3ef13882ddb8bd0b1c165ace9", "ja": "うん、そうだね！\n行きましょう、昴さん、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嗯，说得也是！\n我们走吧，昴、{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1058_047sub", "source_sha256": "36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c", "ja": "ああ！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_05_1059_p", "source_sha256": "93c13987d0eb89a0a2187a3546bfc021b8bca098e4f963bcfd22b42cc2f8c911", "ja": "（ユニットのコンセプトだけでなく、仲間への理解も\n深まったみたいだ。このユニット、期待できそうだ！）", "zh": "（她们不只加深了对团体概念的理解，伙伴之间好像也\n更了解彼此了。我相信这个团体会大有所为的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
